# Qwen1.5-MoE-A2.7B (Qwen2.7B-class) capacity trace for four local GPUs.
# capacity(t)=clip(round(2.2 + 0.9*sin(2*pi*t/240s)
#   + 0.6*sin(2*pi*t/95s) + burst(t)), 2, 4).
# The model starts at its TP2 floor, ramps to four GPUs, loses the TP2 source
# pair during a pressure drop, and then replenishes capacity in staggered
# add/remove events.  Every event stays within node-0..node-3.
